# Keymap edits stay in config/

User keymap and Studio-derived layout changes belong only in `config/`.

- Edit `config/*.keymap` (this repo: `config/piantor_pro_bt.keymap`)
- Do not change `boards/arm/**/*.keymap` or other files under `boards/` unless the user explicitly asks to change board/firmware defaults
- Do not "keep copies in sync" between `config/` and `boards/`

```text
# BAD — board default / original firmware keymap
boards/arm/piantor_pro_bt/piantor_pro_bt.keymap

# GOOD — user config used by the build
config/piantor_pro_bt.keymap
```
